# The mobile workspace stays out of the web upload, except ugc-mobile/lib, which
# is uploaded whole. The web app and the server import its platform-free folders
# (model catalog, resumable media transport, saver notice policy, post publish
# policy, creator settings summary). `next build` also type-checks against the
# upload, so even a file they reach only with `import type` must be in it.
# Gitignore semantics cannot re-include a path whose parent directory is
# excluded, so the workspace's contents are excluded one level down and lib is
# re-included. Without this the Vercel build fails with "Module not found".
# src/__tests__/vercelignore-shared-catalog-modules.test.ts pins these two lines.
ugc-mobile/*
!ugc-mobile/lib
